      "fine_trace_step": 11,
      "description": "Root cause. The reuse guard frees CDEF state only for column-count changes and other configuration deltas. When a later frame changes only the derived row count, this guard does not clear cdef_row_mt before allocated_mi_rows is overwritten, leaving a smaller row-sync array paired with a larger loop bound."
